  editing the shared master catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/LocationMapWidget.tsx) plus the registry
  description (registry/maps.ts → "location-map"). The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry/empty/error copy) and the
  accessibility labels.
*/

